.DS_Store

# All the content from the data folder
## Maybe we can create synthetic data for testing in the future
## glob the contents, not the directory itself, so the negation below works
data/*
## ...except public reference tables, which carry no participant data and are
## a hard dependency of the model. All three are rebuilt by
## code/gbd_reference_data.R; see R/globorisk_risk.R and R/mortality.R.
!data/gbd_ihd_stroke_peru.csv
!data/gbd_mortality_peru.csv
!data/gbd_reference_life_table.csv

